//! Port of acorn 8.19.0 (MIT, Marijn Haverbeke and contributors) producing `crate::estree`.
//! Owner: agent A (tokenizer + parser); `regexp.rs`: agent B. Contract: docs/notes/native-compiler/modules.md.
//!
//! One file per upstream `acorn/src/*.js` file (`index.js` is this file). `node.js` has no
//! counterpart: typed nodes are built directly with byte-offset `start`/`end`.
//! `generated.rs` holds the identifier tables of `src/generated/`, regenerated by
//! `gen/gen_identifier_tables.mjs`.

// The port keeps acorn's control flow shape (nested `if`s) and names (`toAssignable`, which
// consumes the node it converts).
#![allow(clippy::collapsible_if, clippy::collapsible_match, clippy::wrong_self_convention)]

